Modifications in this repository
--------------------------------
Copyright (C) 2026 CollinsLiu

This is an UNOFFICIAL port. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
maintained by the original author or their estate.

What was changed, relative to upstream v1.10:

  * Repackaged for Minecraft 1.6.1 - 1.19.4 as 11 files, one per
    resource-pack format generation, covering 63 release versions.
    Each file declares the exact pack_format of its range, so the game
    never shows a "made for a different version" notice.

  * Texture sheets rescaled or re-mapped where the GUI layout changed
    between versions (creative-inventory tab plates, container panels,
    HUD sheets). All of it is generated at build time by tools/build.py —
    no art was redrawn by hand.

  * Sheets whose layout changed too much were dropped rather than shipped
    misaligned; those screens fall back to vanilla. The per-sheet
    agreement ratios and drop reasons are recorded in work/build-report.json.

  * The original RGB hue cycle is re-implemented as 8-frame sheet
    animations (tools/animate.py), because the sprite-animation format the
    original uses only exists on Minecraft 1.20.2 and newer.

  * Bundled JSON fonts, OptiGUI metadata, sounds and mod textures are
    pruned from the files whose target version cannot read them.

No new art was created for this port.


